# 26. Time and Space Complexity

Let:

```text
V = number of vertices
E = number of edges
```

Building the adjacency list:

```text
O(V + E)
```

Heap operations:

```text
O(E log E)
```

This is commonly written as:

```text
O(E log V)
```

for standard graph complexity analysis.

Overall time complexity:

```text
O(E log V)
```

Space used by the adjacency list:

```text
O(V + E)
```

Space used by the visited array:

```text
O(V)
```

Space used by the heap:

```text
O(E)
```

Overall space complexity:

```text
O(V + E)
```

